{
    "title": "Princess Mermaid Phone",
    "description": "The exciting Princess Mermaid game is a fun experience for everyone, explore the magical underwater world with super fun activities with the princess mermaid!\u00a0It is an underwater fun phone simulator that will allow you to play in the world of Mermaid princess.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- You can talk and chat with the cute little princess, Billy the Crab, and Oscar the Octopus.\r\n- Colorful, Fun, and User-Friendly interactive game.\r\n- Enjoy Wash, dry, comb, color, put accessories, and more with princess hair salon activities\r\n- Makeover princess game, with fun spa activities and royal gorgeous makeup options for the princess.\r\n- Pet doctor to take good care of your underwater virtual pets.\r\n- Creativity-enhancing games for beautiful princess coloring pages with tons of coloring options to fill up in Cake, Mermaid, Ice cream, Castle, and cute unicornfish.\r\n- Fun cooking bake & decorate mermaid princess cupcakes and delicious Narwhal Donuts\r\n- It is the ultimate game with many colors and attractive animations to keep everyone entertained.\r\n- Explore a colorful underwater world with fun mini-games\r\n- Cute relaxing games such as Ocean Jigsaw puzzles, princess spot the difference, and underwater puzzle games.\r\n- Sailing adventure activities like defeating the sea monsters by using cannonballs\r\n- Dodge the fruit bombs and defeat the Crocodile pirate\r\n- Classic pinball fun\r\n- Go on an exciting ocean adventure with a sweet princess mermaid and find the stars\r\n\r\nTry this game now and experience beautiful underwater cute princess mermaid activities with an incredible fun phone simulator!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The exciting Princess Mermaid game is a fun experience for everyone, explore the magical underwater world with super fun activities with the princess mermaid!\u00a0It is an underwater fun phone simulator that will allow you to play in the world of Mermaid princess.<br><br>Features:<br><br>- You can talk and chat with the cute little princess, Billy the Crab, and Oscar the Octopus.<br>- Colorful, Fun, and User-Friendly interactive game.<br>- Enjoy Wash, dry, comb, color, put accessories, and more with princess hair salon activities<br>- Makeover princess game, with fun spa activities and royal gorgeous makeup options for the princess.<br>- Pet doctor to take good care of your underwater virtual pets.<br>- Creativity-enhancing games for beautiful princess coloring pages with tons of coloring options to fill up in Cake, Mermaid, Ice cream, Castle, and cute unicornfish.<br>- Fun cooking bake &amp; decorate mermaid princess cupcakes and delicious Narwhal Donuts<br>- It is the ultimate game with many colors and attractive animations to keep everyone entertained.<br>- Explore a colorful underwater world with fun mini-games<br>- Cute relaxing games such as Ocean Jigsaw puzzles, princess spot the difference, and underwater puzzle games.<br>- Sailing adventure activities like defeating the sea monsters by using cannonballs<br>- Dodge the fruit bombs and defeat the Crocodile pirate<br>- Classic pinball fun<br>- Go on an exciting ocean adventure with a sweet princess mermaid and find the stars<br><br>Try this game now and experience beautiful underwater cute princess mermaid activities with an incredible fun phone simulator!",
